{"id":18325,"name":"Ionia County","slug":"ionia-county","state":"Michigan","code":"MI","program":null,"sourceUrl":"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-deed/tax-deed-states/michigan-tax-deed-sales-property-deals-90-off/ionia-county/","lastUpdated":"2026-07-20T14:50:34","facts":{"taxSaleType":"Tax Deed Sale","bidProcedure":"Premium Bid","deposit":"$1,000 hold on a credit card as a deposit","extra":[{"label":"Typical Date of Sale","value":"Held twice each year, in August and October"},{"label":"Sale Contact","value":"Treasurer’s Office (email)"},{"label":"Auction Site","value":"Michigan Public Land Auction"},{"label":"County Website","value":"Ionia Official County Website"}]},"bodyHtml":"\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed aligncenter is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"baUBiALp2Hf5h1elklMhcSPkpBAnI9qvg0ax4mf8vN37dO6GQZRE2JwPb8DrSKei0\"><iframe title=\"Interested in Buying Homes for 40-90% Less? - Ionia County - Michigan Tax Deed Investing\" width=\"563\" height=\"1000\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/9db7vN9jOFk?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Get Dustin Hahn’s Tax Lien and Deed FREE Mini-Course</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Interested-in-Buying-Homes-for-40-90%-Less?---Ionia-County---Michigan-Tax-Deed-Investing\">Interested in Buying Homes for 40-90% Less? &#8211; Ionia County &#8211; Michigan Tax Deed Investing</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>If you&#8217;re looking for a property deal in Ionia County, <a href=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-deed/tax-deed-states/michigan-tax-deed-sales-property-deals-90-off/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Michigan</mark></a>, you’re in luck! The county auctions tax-foreclosed properties at 40% to 90% off the market price. Here’s how you can get started:</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"How-It-Works\">How Does Ionia Tax Deed Auction Work?</h4>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Registration</strong>: Register online at <a href=\"http://www.tax-sale.info/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Michigan Public Land Auction | Tax-Sale.info</mark></a> and secure your bid with a $1,000 hold on your credit card. This isn’t a charge; it&#8217;s a safety net in case you win but don&#8217;t follow through.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Bidding</strong>: Bidding kicks off 30 days before the auction and continues until 7:00 p.m. on the sale day. You can adjust your bids until the auction starts.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Winning</strong>: If you win, you&#8217;ll receive an email with the next steps, including payment and notarizing your paperwork.</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Key-Details\">Key Details</h4>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Auction-Process\">Auction Process in Ionia County</h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Advance Bidding</strong>: This phase allows you to place your maximum desired bid. Your maximum bid will only be reached if others bid against you.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>No Reserve Auctions</strong>: Bids can start very low if properties don&#8217;t sell initially, making it a great opportunity for a bargain.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Pro-Tips\">Pro Tips</h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Payment Methods</strong>: Accepted payment methods include bank transfer, certified check, or credit/debit card (note that card payments incur an extra fee). No cash or personal checks are accepted.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Auction Preparation</strong>: Check the treasurer’s page in late June or early July for the property list and auction dates.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Follow-Up</strong>: Ensure you follow the instructions in the email you receive if you win a bid, especially regarding payment and paperwork notarization.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Ionia-County-Courthouse-Michigan.webp 1081w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Ionia-County-Courthouse-Michigan-541x360.webp 541w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Ionia-County-Courthouse-Michigan-296x197.webp 296w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Ionia-County-Courthouse-Michigan-768x512.webp 768w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Ionia-County-Courthouse-Michigan-20x13.webp 20w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Ionia-County-Courthouse-Michigan-32x21.webp 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Ionia-County-Courthouse-Michigan.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1081\" srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Ionia-County-Courthouse-Michigan.png 1081w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Ionia-County-Courthouse-Michigan-541x360.png 541w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Ionia-County-Courthouse-Michigan-296x197.png 296w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Ionia-County-Courthouse-Michigan-768x512.png 768w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Ionia-County-Courthouse-Michigan-20x13.png 20w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Ionia-County-Courthouse-Michigan-32x21.png 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" class=\"wp-image-18330 sp-no-webp\" alt=\"Ionia County Courthouse, Michigan\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"  > </picture></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--1\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Book a Call with Dustin Hahn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Important-Links\">Important Links</h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Ionia County Tax Deed Information</strong>: <a href=\"https://ioniacounty.org/departments-officials/treasurer/foreclosure-information/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Foreclosure Information</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Ionia County Treasurer</strong>: <a href=\"https://ioniacounty.org/departments-officials/treasurer/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Ionia County Treasurer</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Ionia County</strong>: <a href=\"https://ioniacounty.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Ionia County Official Website</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Auction Site</strong>: <a href=\"http://www.tax-sale.info/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Michigan Public Land Auction</mark></a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"FAQs\">FAQs</h4>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: What is the redemption period?</strong> A: The redemption period varies by location and specifics of the sale. Contact the county office for detailed information.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: How do I find out about the auction dates and available properties?</strong> A: Visit the <a href=\"https://ioniacounty.org/departments-officials/treasurer/\">Ionia County Treasurer’s page</a> in late June or early July for updated information on property lists and auction dates.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: What happens if I win but don’t follow through?</strong> A: The $1,000 hold on your credit card is a safety measure. If you win and don’t follow through, the hold ensures the county is not at a loss.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: Can I adjust my bids?</strong> A: Yes, you can tweak your bids until the auction starts, providing flexibility and control over your bidding strategy.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>For more detailed information, check the following resources:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://ioniacounty.org/departments-officials/treasurer/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Ionia County Treasurer’s Office</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"http://www.tax-sale.info/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Michigan Public Land Auction</mark></a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p>With this information, you’re ready to dive into tax deed investing in Ionia County and secure great property deals!</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Need Help or Have Questions?</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Learn More</strong>: <a href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Download o<mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">ur FREE ABCs of Tax Liens and Deeds</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Book a Consultation</strong>: If you’re unsure where to start or need expert advice, <a href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">book a consultation call with Dustin Hahn today</mark>.</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n<p><em>Sign up or log in to view the full content.</em></p><div id=\"popup-overlay\"></div><div id=\"signup-popup\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 20px;\"><h4>Get Instant Free Access To The Training Vault Now</h4><p>Learn how to get 18-36% returns on your investment and buy property for as little as $500 with tax lien and tax deeds.</p><div class=\"video-container\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; margin: 20px 0;\"><iframe src=\"https://youtube.com/embed/FkB-M8RaSHo\" allowfullscreen style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 560px; height: 315px; border: none; border-radius: 8px;\"></iframe></div><div class=\"button-container\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\"><button style=\"padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Sign Up for FREE Access</button><button style=\"padding: 10px 20px; font-s